                    <h4>We Stand Behind Every Purchase</h4>
                    <p>If something isn't right with your LuxeCasa order, we'll make it right. This policy applies to
                        all purchases made from <strong>1st January 2025</strong> onwards. Questions? Email <a
                            href="mailto:returns@luxecasa.com">returns@luxecasa.com</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== SECTION 1 ===== -->
            <div class="refund-section" id="sec-overview">
                <button class="sec-toggle" onclick="toggleSec('sec-overview')">
                    <div class="sec-num">1</div>
                    <div class="sec-title-wrap">
                        <h2>Policy <em>Overview</em></h2>
                        <div class="sec-sub">Key highlights of our return and refund policy at a glance</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sec-arrow"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
                </button>
                <div class="sec-body">
                    <div class="sec-divider"></div>
                    <div class="sec-inner">
                        <p>LuxeCasa's Refund & Return Policy is designed to be simple, fair and transparent. We want you
                            to love every piece you bring home. If for any reason you are not completely satisfied, here
                            is what you need to know:</p>
                        <div class="r-table-wrap">
                            <table class="r-table">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Policy Feature</th>
                                        <th>Details</th>
                                        <th>Status</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>Return Window</td>
                                        <td>30 calendar days from delivery date</td>
                                        <td class="tag-yes">✓ Active</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>Return Pickup</td>
                                        <td>Free doorstep collection anywhere in India</td>
                                        <td class="tag-yes">✓ Free</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>Refund Method</td>
                                        <td>Original payment method or bank transfer (COD)</td>
                                        <td class="tag-yes">✓ Full Refund</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>Refund Processing</td>
                                        <td>7–10 business days after quality inspection</td>
                                        <td class="tag-yes">✓ Guaranteed</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>Exchange Option</td>
                                        <td>Available for eligible returns within 30 days</td>
                                        <td class="tag-yes">✓ Available</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>Custom Orders</td>
                                        <td>Non-refundable after Design Approval sign-off</td>
                                        <td class="tag-no">✗ Excluded</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>Warranty Claims</td>
                                        <td>5-year craftsmanship warranty — separate process</td>
                                        <td class="tag-yes">✓ Covered</td>
                                    </tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <div class="r-info-box">
                            <div class="rib-icon"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i></div>
                            <p>This Refund Policy is incorporated into and must be read alongside our <a
                                    href="terms.html">Terms of Service</a>. In the event of any conflict, the Terms of
                                Service shall prevail. This policy does not affect your statutory rights under the
                                <strong>Consumer Protection Act, 2019</strong>.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mark-read-row" onclick="markRead('sec-overview', this)">
                            <span><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="margin-right:6px;color:var(--gold)"></i> Mark as
                                understood</span>
                            <div class="mark-checkbox"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== SECTION 2 ===== -->
            <div class="refund-section" id="sec-eligible">
                <button class="sec-toggle" onclick="toggleSec('sec-eligible')">
                    <div class="sec-num">2</div>
                    <div class="sec-title-wrap">
                        <h2>✅ <em>Eligible</em> Returns</h2>
                        <div class="sec-sub">Situations where a full refund or exchange is guaranteed</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sec-arrow"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
                </button>
                <div class="sec-body">
                    <div class="sec-divider"></div>
                    <div class="sec-inner">
                        <p>The following situations qualify for a full refund or exchange under our 30-Day Return
                            Policy:</p>
                        <ul class="r-list">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span><strong>Unused & Unassembled Products</strong>
                                    — Item is in original condition, unassembled, with all original packaging, hardware,
                                    accessories and documentation intact.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span><strong>Damaged on Arrival</strong> — Product
                                    arrived with visible physical damage, cracks, broken parts or structural failure.
                                    Must be reported within 48 hours of delivery.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span><strong>Wrong Item Delivered</strong> — The
                                    product delivered differs significantly from what was ordered (wrong colour, model,
                                    dimensions or category).</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span><strong>Missing Parts</strong> — Order arrived
                                    with critical components, hardware or accessories missing, making the product
                                    impossible to use.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span><strong>Quality Not As Described</strong> —
                                    Significant discrepancy between the product description/images on the website and
                                    the actual product received.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span><strong>Within Warranty Period</strong> —
                                    Product has a manufacturing or structural defect reported within the 5-year warranty
                                    window (see Section 9).</span></li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="r-success-box">
                            <div class="rib-icon"><i class="fas fa-check-double"></i></div>
                            <p>For all eligible returns, LuxeCasa covers the <strong>full cost of return
                                    shipping</strong>. You will never be charged for returning a product that qualifies
                                under this policy.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mark-read-row" onclick="markRead('sec-eligible', this)">
                            <span><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="margin-right:6px;color:var(--gold)"></i> Mark as
                                understood</span>
                            <div class="mark-checkbox"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== SECTION 3 ===== -->
            <div class="refund-section" id="sec-ineligible">
                <button class="sec-toggle" onclick="toggleSec('sec-ineligible')">
                    <div class="sec-num">3</div>
                    <div class="sec-title-wrap">
                        <h2>❌ <em>Non-Eligible</em> Returns</h2>
                        <div class="sec-sub">Items and situations not covered by this policy</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sec-arrow"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
                </button>
                <div class="sec-body">
                    <div class="sec-divider"></div>
                    <div class="sec-inner">
                        <p>The following situations do not qualify for a return, exchange or refund under our standard
                            policy:</p>
                        <ul class="r-list">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-times-circle"></i><span><strong>Custom & Bespoke Orders</strong> —
                                    Products manufactured to your specific dimensions, fabric, finish or engraving
                                    specifications cannot be returned once manufacturing has commenced.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-times-circle"></i><span><strong>Assembled Products</strong> — Products
                                    that have been assembled, even partially. Once assembled, the product is considered
                                    used.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-times-circle"></i><span><strong>Used or Modified Items</strong> —
                                    Products showing signs of use, wear, modification, or that have been altered from
                                    their original state.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-times-circle"></i><span><strong>Tags & Labels Removed</strong> —
                                    Products from which original LuxeCasa tags, stickers or identification labels have
                                    been removed.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-times-circle"></i><span><strong>Accidental Damage</strong> — Damage
                                    caused by accidents, misuse, improper maintenance, negligence or exposure beyond
                                    normal domestic conditions.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-times-circle"></i><span><strong>Change of Mind (Post-30 Days)</strong>
                                    — Returns requested more than 30 calendar days after the delivery date.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-times-circle"></i><span><strong>Unauthorised Returns</strong> —
                                    Products returned without prior written or email authorisation from our Customer
                                    Experience team.</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-times-circle"></i><span><strong>Natural Variations</strong> — Minor
                                    variations in wood grain, natural texture, colour tone, or weight that are inherent
                                    to natural materials and not manufacturing defects.</span></li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="r-alert-box">
                            <div class="rib-icon"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i></div>
                            <p>Returning a product without LuxeCasa's prior authorisation will result in the product
                                being returned to you at your cost. Always <a href="contact.html">contact our team
                                    first</a> before shipping anything back.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mark-read-row" onclick="markRead('sec-ineligible', this)">
                            <span><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="margin-right:6px;color:var(--gold)"></i> Mark as
                                understood</span>
                            <div class="mark-checkbox"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== SECTION 4 ===== -->
            <div class="refund-section" id="sec-process">
