                    <div class="sec-title-wrap">
                        <h2>Return <em>Process</em></h2>
                        <div class="sec-sub">Step-by-step guide to initiate and complete your return</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sec-arrow"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
                </button>
                <div class="sec-body">
                    <div class="sec-divider"></div>
                    <div class="sec-inner">
                        <p>Returning a product to LuxeCasa is a simple, guided process. Follow these four steps to
                            complete your return smoothly:</p>
                        <div class="steps-grid">
                            <div class="step-card">
                                <div class="step-num-badge">1</div>
                                <div class="step-icon"><i class="fas fa-phone-alt"></i></div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4>Step 1 — Contact Us</h4>
                                    <p>Call +91 98765 43210, WhatsApp, or email <a
                                            href="mailto:returns@luxecasa.com">returns@luxecasa.com</a> within 30 days
                                        of delivery. Share your Order ID and reason for return.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-card">
                                <div class="step-num-badge">2</div>
                                <div class="step-icon"><i class="fas fa-camera"></i></div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4>Step 2 — Submit Evidence</h4>
                                    <p>Send clear photographs of the product, packaging, and any damage or discrepancy.
                                        Our team reviews and approves within 24–48 hours.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-card">
                                <div class="step-num-badge">3</div>
                                <div class="step-icon"><i class="fas fa-box"></i></div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4>Step 3 — Pack & Pickup</h4>
                                    <p>Repack the product securely in its original packaging. Our logistics partner will
                                        collect from your address within 3–5 business days of approval.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-card">
                                <div class="step-num-badge">4</div>
                                <div class="step-icon"><i class="fas fa-rupee-sign"></i></div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4>Step 4 — Refund Issued</h4>
                                    <p>Once the product arrives at our warehouse and passes quality inspection, your
                                        refund is processed within 7–10 business days to the original payment method.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="r-info-box">
                            <div class="rib-icon"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i></div>
                            <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Take a short video of the product before repacking it for
                                return. This protects both parties and speeds up the inspection process significantly.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mark-read-row" onclick="markRead('sec-process', this)">
